{title: Holy Spirit Come Fill This Place}
{key: C}

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Holy Spirit come and [F]fill this place
[G]Bring us healing with Your [C]warm embrace
[Am]Show Your power make your [F]presence known
[F]Holy Spirit come [Am]fill this [G]place
[Dm]Holy Spirit [F]come fill this [C]place

{comment: Post-Chorus}
[F]Breath of God we need a [C]touch from You
[F]Shine down on us with the [Am]light of truth
[F]Stir our hearts and set our [C]spirit free
[F]Holy Spirit come [Am]fill this [G]place
[Dm]Holy Spirit [F]come fill this [C]place

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]My heart is longing just to [C]hear from You
[F]My soul is waiting to know [Am]someone who
[E]Can take us higher [D]help us make it through
So will you [G]please come and set us free

{comment: Verse 2}
[F]Our hearts are hungry for [C]Your perfect peace
[F]Our souls are thirsty for [Am]the joy You bring
[E]So send Your glory [D]make Your praise complete
Send down the [G]rain, touch us once again

{comment: Bridge}
[C]Holy Spirit come and [F]fill this place
[C]Holy Spirit come and [F]fill this place
[C]Holy Spirit come and [F]fill this place
